senses
  entry
    definition "(chemistry) a surface forming a common boundary between two things (two objects or liquids or chemical phases)"
    id oewn-03583604-n
    partOfSpeech n
  entry
    definition "(computer science) a program that controls a display for the user (usually on a computer monitor) and that allows the user to interact with the system"
    id oewn-06587403-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms ("user interface")
  entry
    definition "the overlap where two theories or phenomena affect each other or have links with each other"
    examples ("the interface between chemistry and biology")
    id oewn-05772776-n
    partOfSpeech n
  entry
    definition "(computer science) computer circuit consisting of the hardware and associated circuitry that links one device with another (especially a computer and a hard disk drive or other peripherals)"
    id oewn-03583825-n
    partOfSpeech n
    synonyms (port)
